# CRL Example Metrics

terminology "Office Visit":

- valueset is `http://cts.nlm.nih.gov/fhir/ValueSet/2.16.840.1.113883.3.464.1003.101.12.1001`.

concept "Qualifying Encounter":

- type is Encounter.
- valuetype is codeableconcept.
- coded from "Office Visit".

concept "Minimum Age 50":

- type is Observation.
- valuetype is Quantity.
- inferred from "Patient".
  - apply pattern `Age(birthDate).Minimum(50)`.

metric "Colorectal Screening":

- scoring is continuous-variable.  //optional
- improvement is increase. // optional
- group
  - population "Initial Population" based on ("Qualifying Encounter" and "Minimum Age 50").
  - population "Denominator" based on ("Qualifying Encounter" and "Minimum Age 50").
  - population "Numerator" based on ("Colorectal Exam Within 10 Years").
- end group
